Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Every single night, a terribly lonely young boy wished he could stop time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.21,0:00:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Then one fateful afternoon, his desperate wish unexpectedly came true for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.70,0:00:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He could suddenly freeze everything around him including the heavy rain and people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.60,0:00:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,For a long time, he felt completely invincible like a powerful god.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.71,0:00:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He cleverly used his terrifying new power to easily avoid every painful problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.33,0:00:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,However, he slowly began noticing a horrifying price hidden within his gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.75,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Each time he froze moments, someone he deeply loved permanently forgot his existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.70,0:00:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Desperate to fix everything, he stopped time one final time to whisper quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.22,0:00:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He begged the universe for a fragile world where he could stay present.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.62,0:00:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He finally let time flow forward and chose growing older over living forever.
